# Keep workspace applications that deploy from elsewhere out of the archive.
# class-pass is NOT listed: this file applies to every Vercel project in the
# repo, so excluding an app here makes that app's own deployment fail with
# ERR_PNPM_NO_IMPORTER_MANIFEST_FOUND. Its tracked source is 7.6MB; the 460MB
# seen in a working copy is .next-local-preview, which git never carried.
apps/.claude
apps/academy-ops
apps/interview-mate
apps/interview-pass
apps/police-exam-bank
apps/portal
apps/study-hall

# Root-only development and infrastructure material.
# Leading slash is required: a bare name matches at every depth, so plain
# `supabase` also deleted apps/class-pass/src/lib/supabase and the build failed
# with "Can't resolve '@/lib/supabase/server'".
# scripts/ stays in: every project's ignoreCommand runs scripts/vercel-ignore.mjs,
# and a missing module exits non-zero, which Vercel reads as "build" — so
# excluding it silently disabled the [deploy <app>] tag for the whole repo.
/docs
/supabase
